Bind void to work, given (the series of series of number q):
    Define t as a series of series of series of number with (q).
    Insert a series of number with (1, 2) into item 1 of t.
Done.
Define rows as a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Cast work on (rows).
Done.
State rows.
